{"id":"deab51a1-5226-46a8-8b40-1543d14cb21e","expr":"map != null","rationale":"The method setParameters expects a map argument; typically, map should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeSetParameters(Class,Object,Map):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.472110773Z"}
{"id":"11648c97-30e9-4de7-983d-67078e372ab5","expr":"c.getMethods() != null","rationale":"The method search depends on the methods declared by class c, which cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeSetParameters(Class,Object,Map):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.472110773Z"}
{"id":"3ec773b1-dac9-4e98-a382-68a15ec866c3","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The class 'c' is used to find a method by signature; it must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.484958123Z"}
{"id":"fce08e8e-6633-46c7-b6d0-6ef3cc9417ce","expr":"o == null || c.isInstance(o)","rationale":"Since the method may be invoked on 'o' by reflection, 'o' should be compatible with type 'c' to avoid IllegalArgumentException during method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.484958123Z"}
{"id":"ca64a7df-a57c-4320-8ce1-08af89817518","expr":"!c.isInterface() || o != null","rationale":"Invoking a method reflectively on a null object would fail, so if 'c' is an interface, 'o' generally must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.484958123Z"}
{"id":"0d34f063-0f8e-40f8-a57c-32c4b0987cdb","expr":"! (result != null && !result.isEmpty()) || c != null","rationale":"Because invocation of getParameters depends on a valid class object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.491396044Z"}
{"id":"7017338b-b3ee-4871-9978-d19a822a8f14","expr":"result == null || o != null","rationale":"Because method.invoke(o) requires o to be non-null for successful invocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.491396044Z"}
{"id":"af667e70-7b6e-4f3e-89af-8616844d0646","expr":"result == null || !result.containsKey(null)","rationale":"Typically parameter maps do not contain null keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.491396044Z"}
{"id":"55248bf9-f3f1-4121-bb5f-646676021623","expr":"result == null || !result.containsValue(null)","rationale":"Typically parameter maps do not contain null values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.491396044Z"}
{"id":"aa54100f-a98a-436d-8a66-0ceb513f05bf","expr":"getter != null","rationale":"The method calls getter.startsWith and getter.substring, which require getter to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculateAttributeFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.493001067Z"}
{"id":"9b72b159-5332-4aed-9cec-20055b722b62","expr":"getter.length() >= 3","rationale":"If getter does not start with 'get', substring index 2 is used, but length must be sufficient to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculateAttributeFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.493001067Z"}
{"id":"75e75497-504a-4cbf-8618-894ca5d4dfc1","expr":"getter.length() > 0","rationale":"Generally, the method extracts substrings starting at index 2 or 3, requiring the string to be sufficiently long.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculateAttributeFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.493001067Z"}
{"id":"21884ad4-6aed-4892-9161-8d0f0501ee09","expr":"result.length() == name.length() + 3","rationale":"Result combines 'set' plus capitalization of first character plus rest of 'name', so total length is 'name' length + 3.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculatePropertyToSetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.495365138Z"}
{"id":"3c1dd1dc-74fa-4673-8315-721a9f078e71","expr":"Character.toUpperCase(name.charAt(0)) == result.charAt(3)","rationale":"The first character of 'name' is capitalized and placed at position 3 in 'result'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculatePropertyToSetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.495365138Z"}
{"id":"566680f6-efbd-4684-b322-0472f0019cfe","expr":"result.substring(4).equals(name.substring(1))","rationale":"The remainder of 'name' after the first character is appended to 'result' starting at index 4.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculatePropertyToSetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.495365138Z"}
{"id":"d5cda001-cfab-49f9-a17f-aeac68ef9f5e","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The parameter 'method' should be non-null as it is the subject for inspection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.502050566Z"}
{"id":"02bcda13-eb29-4b1e-aed8-fbd018d0c0ea","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method's name is required and expected to be non-null for identification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.502050566Z"}
{"id":"a24c278a-2add-4d1b-be8f-a90469e88ba4","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The return type reflects the method signature and is expected not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.502050566Z"}
{"id":"f5eef848-65be-4261-aebd-9984b976630e","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"A method always has a non-null parameter type array, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.502050566Z"}
{"id":"a8a78ee6-3f8a-4733-8572-7146099f26d4","expr":"method != null","rationale":"method must be non-null to call getName() and other reflection methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isPropertySetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.516964166Z"}
{"id":"2bc2a9f5-5d23-4ed7-9bf2-62d2a1fc8a11","expr":"method.getName().length() >= 0","rationale":"Method name length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isPropertySetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.516964166Z"}
{"id":"92435e22-d728-446b-b69f-0d2be55f7dff","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isPropertySetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.516964166Z"}
{"id":"92c82f30-5e89-4c26-a9a8-60fb2d393f88","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method object must be non-null to evaluate its properties safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.547935310Z"}
{"id":"47854629-fc59-4d15-8511-ba87d00932ea","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method's name must be non-null to compare to \"setParameters\".","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.547935310Z"}
{"id":"a7d71f11-21ed-45db-bb14-7eb361574441","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The parameter count is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.547935310Z"}
{"id":"741b37d5-74d3-475f-99cc-af4957d8f120","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method return type must be valid and non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.547935310Z"}
{"id":"c3298192-a293-4914-8a09-50ce9dfd0d12","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == method.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Parameter types length aligns with parameter count for consistent reflections.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.547935310Z"}
{"id":"f223f340-b711-4826-aabb-8c0c1fe30df0","expr":"!result || method.getParameterCount() == 1","rationale":"If result is true then the method must have exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isPropertySetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.550685178Z"}
{"id":"0da49113-23ed-4845-b184-5d86ba97c3b5","expr":"!result || method.getParameterTypes().length == 0","rationale":"If the result is true, the method must have zero parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.552813385Z"}
{"id":"da25f30a-6a5c-4c5b-bf6b-8fd7274723f4","expr":"!result || (method.getReturnType() != null && !method.getReturnType().isPrimitive())","rationale":"Non-primitive return type is required for nested getter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.555968827Z"}
{"id":"e028dc65-dffa-4443-841f-adb43e70d791","expr":"!result || method.getParameterCount() == 1","rationale":"Ensures the parameters count condition.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.588359053Z"}
{"id":"f5746a81-f6d4-4dc5-8ac3-846c72df3611","expr":"parameters == null || !parameters.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method returns early if parameters is null or empty, so at method entry, these cases are possible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.592298661Z"}
{"id":"c8431c33-aa85-46bd-9d44-428bd972bded","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"prefix can be any string or null, which affects the prefixing logic in the method","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.592298661Z"}
{"id":"86648127-326e-413e-989f-14fd5ec99cce","expr":"prefix == null || !prefix.contains(\"-\")","rationale":"Given the replacement of '-' with '.' in keys, prefix likely doesn't contain '-'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.592298661Z"}
{"id":"ea0d6017-4169-4d93-9c8b-ee496499170a","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should always be non-null when isNestedSetter is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedSetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.599311095Z"}
{"id":"74d075fd-992a-4ee1-be6b-d7296ad55ed8","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name must be non-null to check if it startsWith 'set' and compare for 'set'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedSetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.599311095Z"}
{"id":"437faa51-230e-4f69-82ef-78e31d77f35d","expr":"method.getParameterCount() == 1","rationale":"The method qualifies as a setter only if it has exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedSetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.599311095Z"}
{"id":"1e764522-7040-419b-82a5-3185cb0b09d4","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new HashMap, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.603471588Z"}
{"id":"2f0f4d9f-00d4-4a1d-b8ee-1748cd2edb17","expr":"parameters == null || parameters.isEmpty() && result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If parameters is null or empty, result is an empty HashMap.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.603471588Z"}
{"id":"1a752066-9619-42b9-92d7-819cf76520e9","expr":"parameters != null && !parameters.isEmpty() && result.size() >= parameters.size()","rationale":"If parameters is not empty, result contains at least one mapping per parameter; it may be larger due to duplicate dot-compatible keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.603471588Z"}
{"id":"72265adb-f06e-4527-962f-7669bba8610a","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a non-null obj to analyze its class and fields.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.611397412Z"}
{"id":"3b4e1465-8f1e-4e4b-a6c0-c620cf59f897","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should be non-null to call its methods like getName() and getModifiers().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.611397412Z"}
{"id":"3455f0e0-d647-4e9b-aa67-41fb393e39c6","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == 0","rationale":"The method must have zero parameters to be considered as a getter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.611397412Z"}
{"id":"3b0957d8-16ac-4cf1-bfa8-2cb81173d684","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns an ApplicationModel instance, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#getApplicationModel():ApplicationModel","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.613266691Z"}
{"id":"96690343-7a85-4cd6-93f9-1bcb709195c6","expr":"scopeModel == null || scopeModel.isValid()","rationale":"Assuming checkScopeModel(scopeModel) enforces validity, input scopeModel should be valid before setting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#setScopeModel(ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.644613573Z"}
{"id":"833facbe-fbac-4a4d-a7bd-e11229c11979","expr":"scopeModel != null","rationale":"scopeModel is used without null checks in the instanceof check, so it must not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#checkScopeModel(ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.657265545Z"}
{"id":"0ae73b4c-bb53-42d3-a7a0-9c1c03d69926","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result should never be null because if the field scopeModel is null, it is set to a non-null default model.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#getScopeModel():ScopeModel","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.658138519Z"}
{"id":"1f707732-b948-4b68-8763-52d2c71f734f","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || newScopeModel != null","rationale":"Usually in a post-processing after changing scope, the new scope model should be non-null if an old one exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.676541329Z"}
{"id":"fd491ed3-c891-472c-ac88-310b78045142","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || oldScopeModel != newScopeModel","rationale":"The method is called after scope model changes, so old and new are expected to differ if old exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.676541329Z"}
{"id":"42829081-44d1-4f6e-aeab-29d14be78303","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || newScopeModel == null || oldScopeModel != newScopeModel","rationale":"A meaningful check for scope model changes is that if both models exist, they should not be identical.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.676541329Z"}
{"id":"52eb8c4d-3f81-4ad5-b146-097c010f3a5f","expr":"(oldScopeModel == null || newScopeModel == null) || !oldScopeModel.equals(newScopeModel)","rationale":"The method processes changes from oldScopeModel to newScopeModel, implying they are not the same when both are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.684950763Z"}
{"id":"991e38fd-f475-41fd-a72f-f8ae60c9bdca","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || newScopeModel != null","rationale":"Since this method is called after changing scope models, if oldScopeModel exists, newScopeModel should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.684950763Z"}
{"id":"f07a3bff-f7d9-49c9-9476-d7d9f2efa206","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || oldScopeModel.getClass().equals(newScopeModel.getClass())","rationale":"It is reasonable that newScopeModel is the same class type as oldScopeModel unless the old one is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.684950763Z"}
{"id":"c4ac914a-0ded-4759-80cd-b342a8ffb6b9","expr":"oldScopeModel == null || newScopeModel == null || oldScopeModel.hashCode() != newScopeModel.hashCode()","rationale":"If both models are non-null, their hashCodes are expected different after the model change.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#postProcessAfterScopeModelChanged(ScopeModel,ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.684950763Z"}
{"id":"a84a52b6-dcaf-4f3f-ba13-d9f21df43a61","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned ExtensionLoader instance for the given type should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#getExtensionLoader(Class<T>):ExtensionLoader<T>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.697730997Z"}
{"id":"d0c09e7d-6afe-4c53-b122-da857a034c2f","expr":"result.getExtensionClass() == type","rationale":"ExtensionLoader is expected to load extensions for the provided type class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#getExtensionLoader(Class<T>):ExtensionLoader<T>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:49.697730997Z"}
