{"id":"276eda34-784b-4a54-95e4-ad3edc8515ab","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Method is used to look up parameters; generally expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.599169304Z"}
{"id":"ea8d8801-5f42-4f61-8113-ef0a9cbe7f44","expr":"key != null","rationale":"Key string is used in parameter lookup, expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.599169304Z"}
{"id":"8e404757-8b09-452b-9d80-a0ec02a32405","expr":"(method == null || method.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If method is non-null, its length is at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.599169304Z"}
{"id":"fb472a67-17c5-4e01-a8d5-2901cdde2f6f","expr":"(key == null || key.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If key is non-null, its length is at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.599169304Z"}
{"id":"6e7d1623-e9c9-4e55-8bf7-52af821ddf3e","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"getMethodPositiveParameter ensures returned value is strictly positive, either from getMethodParameter or the defaultValue which is > 0","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,float):float","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.638256560Z"}
{"id":"4f3cabe7-ff42-46d2-8c0e-71b47e8053a5","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"Returned value is either the 'value' from getMethodParameter if > 0, else defaultValue. So result is >= defaultValue since defaultValue > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,float):float","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.638256560Z"}
{"id":"676411e3-9a3e-4a83-b460-40eb3823dc13","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"Method throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue <= 0, so defaultValue must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641656702Z"}
{"id":"d0009632-6926-4f34-bbdc-877b135a0fd2","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method returns a positive value because if the retrieved value is not positive, it returns the positive defaultValue (which is > 0) instead.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641728698Z"}
{"id":"01da5fa8-bb5b-4dab-8d8d-e104ee906752","expr":"method != null","rationale":"method is used as a key parameter and likely not null in practice to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641656702Z"}
{"id":"e0b461e8-105c-4947-8a23-0c0390b32664","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"Since result is either the positive parameter or defaultValue, it cannot be less than defaultValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641728698Z"}
{"id":"47723578-3a76-40da-8487-0cd4d880ee53","expr":"key != null","rationale":"key is used as a key parameter and likely not null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641656702Z"}
{"id":"32fea7da-26e7-4068-94a5-d9501db4e652","expr":"method.length() > 0","rationale":"If method is non-null and valid, likely non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641656702Z"}
{"id":"e60019f3-f43b-4c40-abd4-3cc3cca174e7","expr":"key.length() > 0","rationale":"If key is non-null and valid, likely non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.641656702Z"}
{"id":"fb7f6c14-ce8a-4de1-a4dd-0b6fffacfeed","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method ensures the returned byte (result) is strictly positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.649819351Z"}
{"id":"2a00eca0-a5be-4d57-9471-f387aa3749bf","expr":"(result == defaultValue) || (result > defaultValue)","rationale":"If getMethodParameter return value is <= 0, result is defaultValue; otherwise, result is the value which is > 0 and > defaultValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.649819351Z"}
{"id":"67e86b00-35b4-4f59-b280-cb7745a30f1b","expr":"method != null || key != null || result != 0","rationale":"The method and key inputs affect the returned value; they should be consistent with result presence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.649819351Z"}
{"id":"5381b26f-5063-48e6-ba4e-13ad09e14abd","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method string should be non-null to look up parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.670202921Z"}
