{"id":"ab65ce80-12d1-4a94-a268-d231376e23bf","expr":"Character.isDefined(defaultValue)","rationale":"defaultValue is a character parameter, and it should be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.670202921Z"}
{"id":"61d11850-214b-460f-b34b-8e1017a250ec","expr":"defaultValue >= 0","rationale":"Characters in Java have non-negative integer values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.670202921Z"}
{"id":"16a77bcb-6c91-4628-9f49-402689700c05","expr":"(key.length() > 0) == (method.length() > 0)","rationale":"It is common for method and key to be either both non-empty or both empty in parameter retrieval.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.670202921Z"}
{"id":"bc4fded8-772b-40e1-a6ad-dc8252db76db","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Since the method uses method as a parameter to fetch another parameter, it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.704717247Z"}
