{"id":"9b02f5ca-747f-4983-8798-d90b9e530f04","expr":"key.length() > 0","rationale":"Keys for method parameters are generally expected to be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.704717247Z"}
{"id":"d6b0d98c-cbbf-4d6d-9dfa-3c9cac90475b","expr":"method.length() > 0","rationale":"Method names are generally non-empty, so this is a reasonable invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.704717247Z"}
{"id":"e9bc3c60-71e0-4f31-a9da-060863b4222e","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"The method explicitly throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue is less or equal to zero; thus, it must be positive when entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.708231364Z"}
{"id":"0a6a189b-cc53-4714-bc90-eea914fbcfbd","expr":"method == null || method.length() >= 0","rationale":"method can be null or a non-null string, so checking its length property is valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#hasMethodParameter(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.709248369Z"}
{"id":"7bc80b97-245f-4687-8ca3-a3777b5d630a","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is expected to be a valid method name string, which is typically non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.708231364Z"}
{"id":"38dc53d0-6401-4f6c-8fc1-8102dde3ac6c","expr":"key == null || key.length() >= 0","rationale":"key can be null or non-null string; length is always >= 0 if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#hasMethodParameter(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.709248369Z"}
