{"id":"5c027a75-57d6-4f0a-a7bf-b8196157f576","expr":"(method == null) == (key != null) || (method != null) || (key == null)","rationale":"Relations among method and key determine the branch followed in method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#hasMethodParameter(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.709248369Z"}
{"id":"0f57021f-2cf1-477f-895a-79e51c560c8e","expr":"(method == null) || method.length() > 0","rationale":"If the method string is not null, presumably it should be non-empty as valid method names are not empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.708231364Z"}
