{"id":"72f3a8de-f31f-48a8-aa3a-371b6c80c457","expr":"result == defaultValue || (method != null && key != null)","rationale":"If result differs from defaultValue, value is non-empty, implying method and key parameters were likely valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.759617968Z"}
{"id":"1c297d4f-6cba-4d23-bcc6-dd918baa4089","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"char values are non-negative integral values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.759617968Z"}
{"id":"6dc366fd-8e4a-4dd9-95ba-2bbf26102b87","expr":"key != null","rationale":"The key parameter must be non-null for the method to perform a meaningful lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getAnyMethodParameter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.805390933Z"}
