{"id":"479bbdde-33da-4503-bb62-fb993d899e48","expr":"(key != null) || result == null","rationale":"If the input key is null, it is plausible that result is null too, as the method delegates the call with key as argument.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getAnyMethodParameter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.812837824Z"}
