{"id":"5cc65d35-6026-477d-a2dc-d254f47cca15","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method either returns 'this' or the result of addParameter, both non-null URL instances.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#addParameterAndEncoded(String,String):URL","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.878225521Z"}
{"id":"95a08c10-6201-4a42-bcf9-a41db68f1a28","expr":"result.toString().contains(key)","rationale":"Because the method adds a parameter based on key, result URL string representation contains the key.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#addParameterAndEncoded(String,String):URL","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.878225521Z"}
