{"id":"f36250ef-62ab-4355-9800-8126ac45c656","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method addParameter is expected to return the URL instance itself or a new URL object, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#addParameter(String,boolean):URL","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:11:54.918361943Z"}
