{"id":"7b9d3dcf-5cce-4955-b967-c94b8924650a","expr":"declaringClass != null && !declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The method returns early if declaringClass is null or primitive, so at entry it must be non-null and not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:18:50.461337650Z"}
