{"id":"ac2b6ec0-fc16-47b7-a693-c8b8aec1ff51","expr":"result == null || Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0))","rationale":"The first character of the property name is always lowercase if the result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.108513155Z"}
