{"id":"357ed43b-3ece-4c77-afda-ffcbe8986837","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method operates on sourceClass to extract generic interfaces and superclass; thus, sourceClass must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.253187958Z"}
