{"id":"7f1519f9-0713-42c3-8cd0-fa839a3fd71b","expr":"!sourceClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The method operates on class types to find parameterized types, which are typically not primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.253187958Z"}
{"id":"12f6d8cd-c62b-4ade-9153-543304e7269a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an unmodifiable set, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.300848270Z"}
{"id":"4c121aff-a1a1-47e0-a777-0940d9c888f0","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length == 0 || sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null","rationale":"Result is empty only if no parameterized types found among interfaces or superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.300848270Z"}
{"id":"4ac9f6df-0961-42a1-8798-6bcf0312bdab","expr":"result.size() <= sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length + (sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null ? 0 : 1)","rationale":"The size of the result cannot exceed the total number of generic interfaces plus superclass, since result is direct parameterized types found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.300848270Z"}
{"id":"b66d428e-4366-4bef-be94-82b3e38e7d4d","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method explicitly returns early if sourceClass is null, so it is non-null on entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.342412842Z"}
