{"id":"a979947d-58f9-4c46-b8f6-0bd389a55b77","expr":"matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) || !matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"The method uses matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) in a conditional, so this predicate is meaningful at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.342412842Z"}
{"id":"05fee593-a4b3-44d1-8f74-d1df04057a8c","expr":"sourceClass.getSuperclass() == null || sourceClass.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Superclass can be null (for Object) or non-null, so this invariant covers that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.342412842Z"}
{"id":"a5a4b665-9956-4684-b240-98ade5a753db","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null set because it either returns emptySet or an unmodifiable set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:39.383289809Z"}
