{"id":"f1f13705-4004-4c94-8eca-0851b9156500","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The parameter clazz must be non-null to safely call clazz.getDeclaredConstructor() without throwing NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:41.713300156Z"}
{"id":"19b35952-5759-4f44-8e94-cb8a0f98044a","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"If clazz is an interface, getDeclaredConstructor() would throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:41.713300156Z"}
{"id":"1de697d0-0108-4ebf-b769-0978f1356713","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"If clazz is an array class, getDeclaredConstructor() would likely throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:41.713300156Z"}
{"id":"5b6814ca-9b54-4042-a30b-bd83de6db989","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"If clazz represents a primitive type, getDeclaredConstructor() would throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:41.713300156Z"}
{"id":"c6c80667-2ecb-4c71-a690-01a01a88573a","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredConstructors().length >= 0","rationale":"The class may have zero or more constructors declared, since constructor count is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:41.713300156Z"}
