{"id":"d139ba22-d257-43ea-b605-9f7ef4b63520","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The className is expected to be non-null since it will be used to load a class either via classHolder or ClassUtils.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T10:20:46.007194822Z"}
